                <pb facs="0888" n="802" xml:id="pg802"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-25"><hi rendition="#italic">December 25,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen states that he has been authorized by President Castro to communicate
                    the following:</p>
                <p>“The Government of Venezuela declares itself in favor in principle of arbitration
                    by The Hague tribunal.”)</p>
            </div>
